SCOPE OF THIS LICENCE

Apache-2.0 covers THIS DIRECTORY -- src/CryptinSDK/, the client library --
and src/CryptinCli/, the command-line client built on it, which carries its
own copy of the licence and its own NOTICE.

The rest of the repository is GPL-3.0 and stays that way:

  src/CryptinPersonal/   the Windows application
  src/CryptinUpdater/    the firmware flashing tool
  tests/                 the compatibility gate and the hardware harness

The dongle firmware is not part of this repository.

That split is deliberate. The library and the CLI are the parts third parties
are meant to build on, so they carry the permissive licence; the application
is not. The direction also matters legally: a GPL-3.0 application may link an
Apache-2.0 library, which is what CryptinPersonal does. The reverse would not
work.

