Resources/bip39_english.txt
    The standard BIP-39 English wordlist, from
    https://github.com/bitcoin/bips/blob/master/bip-0039/english.txt
    (SHA-256 2f5eed53a4727b4bf8880d8f3f199efc90e58503646d9ff8eff3a2ed3b24dbda).
    Byte-identical to the copy compiled into the Crypt-in firmware; the
    project's pre-commit check compares the two by SHA-256 on every commit,
    because a divergence would mean a phrase the dongle accepts and the host
    rejects, discovered in the middle of a recovery.

