WHY THIS LIBRARY COULD BE RELICENSED AT ALL

CryptinCipher was written from the normative specification in
CRYPTIN_FILE_FORMAT.md, not ported from the legacy GPL-3.0 implementation in
KriptC# (architecture decision of 2026-08-01, option C). Had it been a port it
would have been a derivative work, and this file would have been a harder
document to write. The compatibility gate existing before the code is what
made writing from the specification practical.
